  "description": "I missed the notice and was unable to apply for a dormitory. Fortunately, with the help of a professor, she becomes a working scholar at the attached animal research institute in the mountains next to the school. On the way to the animal research institute, Dawn finds a cat attacked by a wild boar and tries to protect it. 'still'. In fact, there's a huge secret hidden in it.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=3625622), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/rhdygks_sk), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/nyangman), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/C000049459), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=200305), [Toomics](https://toomics.com/click/intro?cno=7971&pid=conist), Joara, [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=j45v), [Qtoon](https://www.qtoon.co.kr/toon/list.mg?tcode=ghw0)\n\n**Official Translation:**  \n[French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/daf_0000098), Russian, [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/61163)  \nThai: [Lezhin](https://www.lezhinth.com/titles/1056), [Boomtoon](https://www.boomtoon.com/detail/meovv)",
